This is a sample java application which 
contains 

Product.java -- which acts as the entity class and contains all the table constraints

ProductController.java -- which acts the RestController and handled all the HTTP requests like POST,GET,PUT,DELETE

ProductRepository.java -- which acts as the interface that is implemented extending JPARepository

ProductService.java -- which is the service layer that contains the main logic of all the actions which are used in productController

SpringBootJpaApplication.java -- which is the main file which contains the SpringBoot IOC Container

